565
00:32:41,801 --> 00:32:45,800
It will come out in sheet and it will fall into the breakup

566
00:32:45,801 --> 00:32:49,400
It's cascading into the break-up drum, tumbling,

567
00:32:49,500 --> 00:32:51,300
and it's falling into the tray.

568
00:32:54,300 --> 00:32:56,540
Now the hard, sour centers of the lemonheads

569
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:58,540
need their soft, sweet shells.

