576
00:33:20,700 --> 00:33:25,080
He will mix it in, stir it, and use that as the glue

577
00:33:25,180 --> 00:33:26,840
for the panning process.

578
00:33:26,940 --> 00:33:31,140
This is enough to handle all 10 pans of candy.

579
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:45,800
Next, sugar adds bulk and sweetness to each center.

580
00:33:45,801 --> 00:33:49,800
Ferrara pan goes through 200,000 pounds of sugar each day.

581
00:33:53,400 --> 00:33:55,340
At just the right moment, it's time

582
00:33:55,341 --> 00:33:58,340
to add the lemon head's signature ingredient,

583
00:33:58,341 --> 00:34:01,920
a lemon concentrate that gives each candy its super sour

