00:34:01,921 --> 00:34:03,920
punch.

585
00:34:03,921 --> 00:34:06,380
When Martín added the lemon flavor,

586
00:34:06,381 --> 00:34:08,920
we were standing behind him several feet,

587
00:34:08,921 --> 00:34:13,420
and it was enough of an intensity to cause everyone around

588
00:34:13,421 --> 00:34:14,420
to tear up.

589
00:34:14,421 --> 00:34:17,920
So the flavor that we're putting on is a three-fold lemon.

590
00:34:18,020 --> 00:34:19,920
It's a very concentrated lemon.

591
00:34:20,020 --> 00:34:22,820
It's put on that wafer's intense flavor impact.

