625
00:36:34,681 --> 00:36:38,380
This is our cotton candy center, as you can see here.

626
00:36:38,381 --> 00:36:42,420
I'll go ahead and get it started up.

627
00:36:42,421 --> 00:36:44,120
As the sugar in the spinning cylinder

