629
00:36:49,981 --> 00:36:52,980
In the cool air, it solidifies into strands

630
00:36:52,981 --> 00:36:56,340
and accumulates along the machine's inner walls.

631
00:36:56,341 --> 00:36:58,640
You want to use a bottler sugar.

